    - year_of_creation (bool): Include the year the artwork was created. Defaults to False.
    - additional_info (bool): Include additional information about the artwork. Defaults to False.
    - artwork_type (str): The type of artwork.
    - medium (str): The medium used in the artwork.
    - language (str): The language for the information. Defaults to English.

